1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,730
Oops, the ceiling. There. Bonjour.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:07,110
I am Louis, King of France.

3
00:00:08,020 --> 00:00:11,320
They call me the Sun King. Yes...

4
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:12,650
I'm that handsome.

5
00:00:14,680 --> 00:00:16,890
A hundred people watch me wake up.

6
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:19,120
I call it...

7
00:00:19,140 --> 00:00:20,350
opening night.

8
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:23,750
The doctor. The surgeon.

9
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:26,960
Nobody came to see them.

10
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:28,600
Everyone came for me.

11
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:29,930
Naturally.

12
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,640
Now, the wig.

13
00:00:31,660 --> 00:00:33,550
My hair started falling out at seventeen.

14
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:37,930
I took it personally.

15
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:39,930
They say it makes me taller.

16
00:00:42,420 --> 00:00:44,010
I never look down.

17
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:47,790
White, grey, a little powder.

18
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:50,610
One day, everybody will wear this.

19
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:52,210
I'm just early.

20
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:56,210
Bow. Lower. Good.

21
00:00:56,940 --> 00:00:59,670
Yes, this is the new wig. Take notes.

22
00:01:00,540 --> 00:01:03,370
All these people, and
nobody may speak before me.

23
00:01:03,920 --> 00:01:07,530
I love listening. To myself, mostly.

24
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:10,990
Lower. Lower...

25
00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:12,910
and there goes the hat.

26
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:14,990
Eyes on me, not on the hat.

27
00:01:15,460 --> 00:01:16,490
Red heels.

28
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:19,260
Nobles only, and only the ones I like.

29
00:01:19,280 --> 00:01:21,930
Mine are the tallest, of course.

30
00:01:31,160 --> 00:01:32,470
Venice kept the secret.

31
00:01:33,600 --> 00:01:34,580
So we...

32
00:01:34,600 --> 00:01:35,950
borrowed their glassmakers.

33
00:01:37,440 --> 00:01:39,810
Now every wall looks at me.

34
00:01:41,320 --> 00:01:44,270
Mon Dieu, don't stand behind me,
you're spoiling my reflection.

35
00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:45,890
Go. Over there. Further.

36
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:49,690
Next time, I dine in public.

37
00:01:50,220 --> 00:01:52,250
You may watch... but don't stare.

38
00:01:53,980 --> 00:01:55,490
Well, a little.

39
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:58,290
Subscribe to my stunning channel.

40
00:01:59,020 --> 00:02:00,630
Hit like. Ring the bell.

41
00:02:01,300 --> 00:02:02,550
Anyway, do what you like.

42
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:07,420
I'm off to the table to feast!
